#. the summary of a mission, one or two short sentences
#: data/missions/03_salt_for_the_winter/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Aga hoards the salt. Fetch salt and bring it to the villages before winter."
msgstr ""
"Aga skuplja svu sol za sebe. {crew|Nabavi|Nabavi|Nabavite} sol i {crew|donesi|donesi|donesite} je "
