#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/04_oak_for_master_ivan/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Venice stands on wooden piles of alder, a wood which does not rot in the water, and its houses "
"rest on stone from Istria."
msgstr ""
"Venecija stoji na drvenin kolcima od johe, drva koje ne gnjije u vodi, a kuće počivaju na kamenu "
